    "en": "The Dragon King's Silent Bride: A Witch's Voice Lost to Fate"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Olivia, a witch whose magic was once woven through song, lost her voice after saving a wounded black dragon as a child. Powerless and quiet, she now lives a secluded life with her elder sister—until fate calls once more.\n\nSummoned to the Dragon Kingdom as the savior of King Liberto, Olivia finds herself caught in a political tug-of-war. The cold, disinterested Dragon King has no intention of marrying, while his advisors push to find him a powerful bride. But despite his aloof nature, Liberto begins to visit Olivia, drawn to the gentle silence she carries.\n\n---\n[Original Web Novel](https://ncode.syosetu.com/n9924gg)"
  },
